&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Chief of Staff is part of the senior leadership team of the Vinted-wide Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics function. Your primary role will be to build an aligned, engaged, and impactful team while ensuring the successful management and execution of key data strategies and initiatives. The Chief of Staff reports directly to the Vice President of Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics (“VP of DSA”) and acts as a trusted advisor and partner in ensuring that the department runs smoothly, efficiently, and effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a fixed-term (maternity cover) position for approximately 1 year.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to the VP of DSA, providing advice and guidance on all matters within the function (e.g. operating cadence, planning, problem analysis, communication).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and run the function’s reporting cycles end-to-end (e.g. QBRs, OKR meetings, DSA All Hands); including content creation, preparation, facilitation, and follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for coordinating the development and driving the execution of key function strategies and initiatives&amp;nbsp; (e.g. data related initiatives that drive long-term impact), and supporting broader cross-functional and organisational initiatives that involve DSA (e.g. reorganisations and operating model shifts).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and manage recurrent DSA operations (e.g. DSA’s onboarding programme as well as the Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics Academy programme).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery of key functional events, including planning groups and agenda development (e.g. offsites, function week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for maintaining an efficient operating model by ensuring processes, policies, and ceremonies are in place and effective, fostering an aligned, engaged, and impactful team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the DSA leadership team on the integration of AI into our data team’s (300+ team members) workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the driving force behind the senior and extended DSA leadership teams; coordinating and managing meetings, keeping track of decisions and pending relevant actions, holding the group accountable, and ensuring follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Co-) author key documents on function-related topics, ranging from vision and strategy papers to process and standards documentation, based on high-level instructions and discussions with the team and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct research and analysis on industry trends, best practices, and emerging technologies related to the function, and provide recommendations to the DSA leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the organisation and documentation of the function’s governance (e.g., Google Groups, Drive, Confluence spaces, Slack Channels).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in strategy, consulting, or strategic transformation roles, with a track record of success in project management, management engagement, and strategic planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to break complex initiatives and challenges into manageable deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills, with the ability to manage multiple projects and initiatives simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership and interpersonal skills, with the ability to work collaboratively and build relationships across all levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong facilitation and moderation skills, with experience designing and leading workshops to discuss strategic priorities, build alignment, and drive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable interpreting aggregate (analytical) data and turning it into actional conclusions –&amp;nbsp;but advanced data analysis skills are not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to effectively convey complex information to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on and detail-oriented problem solver, able to identify operational gaps and inefficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and comfortable operating under ambiguity, with the ability to pivot quickly, reprioritise effectively, and respond to emerging challenges with a solutions-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per your workday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Plan with Vinted matching 150% of your chosen contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental Private Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidised Deutschlandticket for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€83.300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€112.700 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Senior Associate - Venture &amp;amp; Growth (m/f/d)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team rewriting the rules in private markets.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moonfare delivers what few others can: the highly sought-after funds and hidden-gem investments that go beyond what most private banks offer. Every opportunity is subjected to a ruthless vetting process; the bar is unforgivingly high. The result? Institutional-quality portfolios for investors who demand more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines finance veterans with talent from tech, consulting, law and industries you’d never expect. Headquartered in Berlin, we operate from eight offices across Europe, the US and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build what&#39;s next in private markets, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn Moonfare&#39;s access to the world&#39;s leading venture managers into a steady, well-underwritten flow of single-company investments our clients can actually buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A significant share of Moonfare&#39;s AuM sits in venture and growth, and the direct side of it, co-investments and secondaries in VC-backed companies, is where the business is growing fastest. Right now that dealflow arrives faster than we can review it, which puts the deployment of our proprietary funds at risk and caps how far the direct platform can scale. The scope of this role begins the moment an opportunity reaches us and ends when the deal closes, so operations sits outside it, as does the client raise itself. Your first year is weighted towards screening, pipeline and diligence, with the sourcing and business development side building from there as your market view and relationships deepen. You will work alongside senior members of the team rather than alone, and what moves forward is decided together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venture &amp;amp; Growth sits inside Moonfare&#39;s Investment team and runs two connected things. One is a multi-manager vehicle making primary fund investments into leading VC and growth managers across the US and Europe, where we have historically backed Founders Fund, a16z, Accel, Lightspeed, Khosla and General Catalyst. The other is the direct programme of co-investments and secondaries that those manager relationships generate, which is where this role&#39;s centre of gravity sits. You will report to the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing and work daily with the commercial team, who depend on you for qualified dealflow, and alongside Legal and Operations to close deals and launch the SPVs we distribute on the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the direct deal pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Everything from the moment an opportunity reaches us through to close is yours to run, so nothing sits unscreened and no access window quietly closes while we are still deciding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Screen inbound co-investments and secondaries, and bring a view to the team. &lt;/strong&gt;You run the first pass on what reaches us and form a position on it. What progresses is decided together with the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing and the wider team, so the value of your screen lies in the quality of the argument you bring to that conversation and in how sharply you separate the two or three worth our time from the rest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run diligence on direct deals. &lt;/strong&gt;The core of it is judgement on the business itself: how good the company is, how strong the founding team is, how large and how contested the market is, and whether the thesis survives contact with the evidence. The technical layer sits underneath, with cap table analysis, preference stacks and waterfalls, and pricing and NAV work on secondary positions, so we know exactly what we are buying and at what price. You will do this with support from senior members of the team, and contribute to primary fund diligence alongside the direct mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Author the investment memos that go to IC. &lt;/strong&gt;The committee decides on what you put in front of it, so a memo with a gap in it, an inaccuracy, or a risk nobody spotted becomes a decision made on the wrong basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the market view, and then the market position. &lt;/strong&gt;Relationships with intermediaries, GPs and, over time, founders are what get us into constrained opportunities and keep us current on where secondaries are pricing. This part of the role grows as you do, and watching how competitors structure and go to market belongs to it, because that is what keeps us competitive on price.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the process repeatable. &lt;/strong&gt;You will refine how we diligence direct deals and contribute to the sourcing, screening and monitoring tooling behind it, including AI-enabled approaches, so the volume we can handle is not capped by how much a person can read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn deals into something our clients can buy. &lt;/strong&gt;The commercial team depends on this seat for qualified dealflow and for support packaging opportunities into investor-ready materials. Fund deployment runs at the pace this work sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next Moonfarian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Four or more years centred on venture and growth investing. &lt;/strong&gt;That comes along one of two paths. Either direct investment expertise, sourcing and diligencing investments in technology companies at a venture capital, growth equity or crossover fund, or an allocator seat focused on VC and growth where you have underwritten co-investments hands-on. Directly relevant adjacent backgrounds include TMT and technology investment banking, tech-focused private equity or software buyout, corporate development or corporate VC at a technology company, and consulting with a tech or commercial diligence focus. What matters most is a demonstrable track record of hands-on deal work: screening opportunities, running diligence, and taking a view through to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A network in venture you can already use. &lt;/strong&gt;This one is non-negotiable. Relationships with GPs, intermediaries such as placement agents and bankers, and other LPs and co-investors, enough to get us access to constrained opportunities, support diligence and track spin-out candidates. You do not need the network of someone twice your experience. You do need a real one, and you will build a much larger one here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment judgement you can defend. &lt;/strong&gt;You form a view on a company and argue it, including the case against. You can read a business and a founding team, size a market and test a thesis against what the evidence actually supports. You are genuinely fluent in emerging technology and can develop conviction on themes and business models, with AI front of mind but not the only lens. You assess attractiveness quickly on limited or imperfect information, you are comfortable with financial modelling and market analysis, and you know your way around cap tables, preference stacks and waterfalls, secondary pricing, VC term sheets and SPV mechanics. You can hold several live opportunities at once and prioritise sharply between them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial instinct, which matters here as much as the investing. &lt;/strong&gt;This one is non-negotiable too. This is a builder&#39;s seat as much as an investor&#39;s. You want a hand in structuring, go-to-market, process design and the operational scaffolding of a business line that is still being built. Your AI fluency goes past using the tools to designing processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication that works in three different rooms, and relationships that outlast any one deal. &lt;/strong&gt;You can pitch and tailor to an investment committee, to a commercial team, and to clients, and prepare the reports and presentations each of them needs. Just as important is what you build over time with GPs and intermediaries, the standing that makes them think of us when something scarce comes up, because that is what turns a contact list into access. Excellent written and spoken English is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How the role is measured:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deals sourced, screened, and taken through to IC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely deployment of Moonfare&#39;s proprietary funds, such as the Moonfare Technology Fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocation secured with GPs and intermediaries, meaning access we would not otherwise have had.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whether IC can decide on your memos without rework, and whether risks surface in diligence rather than after close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capital raised on direct deals and the performance ultimately generated. These are programme outcomes you contribute to rather than own alone, and they are read that way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By six months,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;the deal pipeline runs without the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing having to chase it. Opportunities are screened as they arrive, you are bringing a formed view on each one to the team, and the queue is visible to everyone who needs it.|&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By twelve months, &lt;/strong&gt;deal review is fully operationalised, with a process the team can run rather than one person&#39;s habits, and more than ten direct deals have been through IC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is unlikely to be a good match if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prefer to let relationships develop slowly and mostly in writing.&lt;/strong&gt; Much of our access comes from conversations with managers and intermediaries you do not know yet, and someone reserved about starting them will find the sourcing half of this job hard going.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want a defined process to work inside. &lt;/strong&gt;A good part of what this role runs does not exist yet, and you would be designing it while live deals are moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want sole authority over what you invest in.&lt;/strong&gt; We discuss deals as a team and decide together what progresses, which means your view gets argued with before it gets acted on. If you want to run your own book without that, this will frustrate you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What your growth could look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next step from here is Associate Principal. Getting there means leading the majority of diligence processes rather than running them with support, and having a network that generates opportunities rather than one that keeps you informed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you get here that you would not get at a fund: you join the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing in GP conversations from early on and inherit access to a built-up base of manager relationships. You see the commercial side of raising capital for a deal alongside the investment side, which most investors never touch. And you help build a wider business, across a discretionary fund, capital raising for individual deals and, in time, a secondary market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you feel you do not meet all of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We can only accept applications from those eligible to live and work in&amp;nbsp;Berlin/London.&amp;nbsp;This is a hybrid role with office attendance required 4 days/week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that we do not accept applications sent by email. You should submit your application directly through our careers website.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Impact: You are empowered to bring ideas, make decisions, and see your work directly contribute to Moonfare&#39;s success.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Environment: We believe in open communication. You will receive regular updates on company strategy, performance against our KPIs, and key business decisions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We support your development with an individual growth budget of €1,500 or 2% of your base salary (whichever is higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Your Future: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your long-term financial goals with a company pension scheme, providing a 20% employer contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relax and Recharge: &lt;/strong&gt;You start with 25 vacation days and you’ll receive one additional day for each year of tenure, up to a maximum of 30 days. Moonfare gifts two days during our annual end of year company shutdown.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Lunch: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a free lunch every day that you are in the Berlin office, with a weekly changing menu that includes salads, curries, pastas, and a variety of vegan and vegetarian options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised Public Transport: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your commute with a monthly subsidy for the Deutschland job ticket, making your travel easier and more affordable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fitness and Wellbeing: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay active with a subsidised Urban Sports Club membership, giving you flexible access to a wide variety of sports and wellness activities across Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Culture of Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Join a team of ambitious, smart, and committed professionals who are passionate about revolutionising private market investing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reward: &lt;/strong&gt;As a performance-first company, we reward strong performance twice a year, so your impact translates directly into how your pay grows - through potential base salary increases and/or bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our clients come first, Moonfare comes second, and we prioritise ourselves third - Client-Centric Focus. &lt;/strong&gt;Putting clients first means creating value for them is essential. Placing Moonfare second signifies that our individual professional future at Moonfare depends on the company&#39;s commercial success. Prioritising ourselves third reflects our humility in putting clients and Moonfare before personal interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We pursue excellence and honor our promises - Commitment to Excellence. &lt;/strong&gt;We hold ourselves to the highest standards, taking responsibility for our failures, and celebrating our successes. We commit to deadlines and stick to them and we learn from our mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are here to win and to celebrate our collective achievements - Win together. &lt;/strong&gt;We are mission-focused and think and act like owners. We exemplify the attitude we expect and each of us commits to do what it takes to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We foster personal growth but each of us earns our place as a Moonfarian through merit - Growth and Merit.&lt;/strong&gt; We hire, retain, and develop exceptional people and invest in empowering them to excel. We must all earn our place at the table every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand the important role that diversity plays in our success. Different backgrounds, experiences and ideas push us further and raise the bar. We’re committed to developing an inclusive and safe culture where everyone - regardless of colour, race, religion, sex, origin, sexuality, disability, marital status, citizenship or gender identity - knows that they are an integral part of the team and can bring their full potential to their work.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Senior Project Manager (German Speaking)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Germany (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt; German Speaking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is looking for a high-energy, strategic, and results-driven Senior Project Manager to lead complex, enterprise customer implementations and help shape the future of our delivery practice. In this role, you will be customer-facing, acting as a trusted advisor to ensure deployment success, business value realisation, and operational efficiency. You will own high-stakes client engagements end-to-end, bringing deep project management expertise to solve problems on the ground and drive customer outcomes with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Project Manager in our PS Organisation, you will drive impact primarily through hands-on delivery excellence, leadership, and practice enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Client Delivery Excellence&lt;br&gt;● Drive Complex Engagements: Lead end-to-end delivery of complex, concurrent, enterprise-level&amp;nbsp;customer projects from kickoff to sign-off within fast-paced environments.&lt;br&gt;● Scope &amp;amp; Milestone Management: Prepare enterprise customers for deployment, establish clear&amp;nbsp;success criteria, track deliverables, set targets, manage resources, and ensure project execution&amp;nbsp;adheres to deadlines and budgets.&lt;br&gt;● Risk &amp;amp; Issue Governance: Proactively identify, track, and mitigate project risks and technical&amp;nbsp;dependencies, resolving issues autonomously before they escalate.&lt;br&gt;● Stakeholder Alignment: Serve as the single point of contact and escalation owner for customer&amp;nbsp;executives, cross-functional internal teams (Engineering, Customer Support, Sales), and third-&amp;nbsp;party partners.&lt;br&gt;● Quality &amp;amp; Performance: Execute quality control throughout project lifecycles to ensure deliverables meet or exceed Rubrik&amp;amp;#39;s standards and customer business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. PMO &amp;amp; Process Optimisation&lt;br&gt;● Partner with PS leadership to help build, refine, and maintain the PMO governance framework, including standard operating procedures, project methodologies, and key performance indicators.&lt;br&gt;● Continuous Improvement: Flag bottlenecks and recommend improvements that enhance&amp;nbsp;operational efficiency, margins, and customer satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;● Assist in establishing best practices for your engagements, resource allocation, utilisation tracking, and project health reporting across the PS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 8+ years of direct Project Management experience delivering customer-facing, enterprise technical projects within a Professional Services or Consulting organisation.&lt;br&gt;● Previous experience with managing customers from Financial Services, Government, Healthcare&amp;nbsp;industries&lt;br&gt;● Track record of managing multiple complex, high-visibility client engagements concurrently in a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced technology environment.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrated ability to work autonomously, exercising strong judgment and decision-making in&amp;nbsp;ambiguous, high-pressure customer situations.&lt;br&gt;● Expert knowledge of modern project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Jira, Confluence,&amp;nbsp;Asana) as well as Google Workspace.&lt;br&gt;● Fluent written and spoken German and English skill is a must.&lt;br&gt;● Exceptional executive communication, stakeholder management, negotiation, and conflict&amp;nbsp;resolution skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Recognised credentials like Project Management Professional (PMP), PRINCE2, knowledge of Agile/Scrum (CSM, PMI-ACP), or Lean frameworks.&lt;br&gt;● Technical Background: Prior hands-on experience or foundational knowledge in Data&amp;nbsp;Management, Cloud Infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), Data Protection, Enterprise Storage,&amp;nbsp;Cybersecurity, or SaaS delivery is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;● Financial acumen regarding professional services metrics (e.g., revenue recognition, margin,&amp;nbsp;utilization, project profitability).&lt;br&gt;● Experience contributing to PMO governance practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services transforms possibilities into outcomes. Our portfolio of services uncovers&amp;nbsp;and exploits the unique opportunities made possible by Rubrik technology. Drawing on our unparalleled&amp;nbsp;product expertise and customer experiences, we collaborate with customers to identify and address&amp;nbsp;complex technical challenges, improve operational efficiency, and maximize their investment in Rubrik.&amp;nbsp;We are 100% focused on customer success, operational excellence, and empowering our team members&amp;nbsp;to grow, lead, and innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;THE POSITION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join one of our &lt;strong&gt;Core Marketing Platforms teams&lt;/strong&gt;, where&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;build and&amp;nbsp;optimize&amp;nbsp;high-performance microservices that power FanDuel&#39;s marketing ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;work on systems enabling critical capabilities such as real-time customer communications, personalized promotions, and targeted campaign delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your work will focus on designing highly scalable, event-driven systems that process large volumes of real-time data, delivering intelligent insights to marketing partners.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;help enable data-driven, personalized experiences for millions of customers across our platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;work within a modern microservices and event-driven architecture, building&amp;nbsp;Martech&amp;nbsp;solutions enhanced by AI to drive customer engagement and retention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
