&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About DataCamp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data and AI skills are critical for thriving today, and DataCamp is the platform that empowers everyone to learn them. We help individuals and Fortune 1000 companies close the data and AI skills gap through world-class learning, hands-on training, and a global community of expert instructors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll build the partnerships function that scales our curriculum—bringing the world&#39;s leading content providers, technology vendors, and highest-profile instructors onto DataCamp so millions of learners can build the skills that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role that reports to our Content organization. You will own the partnership strategy end-to-end, personally close the deals that define it, and then build a small team behind you as the function grows. Here&#39;s what your day-to-day will look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own DataCamp&#39;s partnership strategy for curriculum: which content providers, technology vendors, and marquee experts we partner with, in what order, and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source, negotiate, and close partnerships—licensed and co-branded content, official vendor certifications, and marquee instructor deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage senior relationships across the AI, data, and cloud ecosystem, from partner leadership through to their content and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with curriculum, product, legal, and marketing to take partnerships from signed agreement to live content that learners actually complete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define what a high-quality partner looks like for DataCamp and hold the bar—prioritizing depth and learner impact over volume of logos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial and contractual side of partnerships, including licensing terms, revenue share, and instructor agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach, and grow a small partnerships team over time, while continuing to carry your own portfolio of relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on partnership performance to leadership, and make the call on which partnerships to double down on and which to retire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5+ years in partnerships, alliances, or business development at a B2B SaaS or technology company, with a track record of sourcing and closing deals you personally led.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in the AI, data, and cloud landscape. You know who the players are, how the ecosystem is shifting, and which partners will matter in 18 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the education, EdTech, or enterprise L&amp;amp;D market, and a real understanding of what makes learning content valuable to a buyer and to a learner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build a function from near-scratch: you’re a self-starter and are able to seamlessly switch from strategy to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and negotiation skills, including comfort with licensing, revenue share, and content rights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional judgment. You can hold your own with content, product, and legal teams and translate between partner ambitions and internal reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus if you have the following&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An existing network across AI and data technology vendors, certification bodies, or the creator and expert community in data and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of the DataCamp course format—you have an intuitive sense of what makes a great DataCamp course.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an educator or curriculum developer in technical education.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Datacamp?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining DataCamp means becoming part of a dynamic, creative, and international start-up. Here are just a few of the reasons why you&#39;ll love being on our team:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exciting Challenges&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle some of the most important educational challenges in Data &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with the Best Instructors&lt;/strong&gt; – Partner with top-tier instructors from leading organizations like Microsoft, Hugging Face, AWS, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer a competitive salary with attractive benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt; – Benefit from flexible working hours and a remote-friendly culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Access to a yearly learning &amp;amp; development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Culture&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team that values international collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Retreats&lt;/strong&gt; – Participate in international company retreats, fostering a global team spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Setup&lt;/strong&gt; – Receive an annual IT equipment budget to refresh your workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our competitive compensation package offers additional benefits. On top of your salary you will also receive extra legal benefits such as best-in-class medical insurance including dental and vision. Depending on your location additional benefits might be available to you.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gram Games is the studio behind popular titles like 1010!, Six!, Merge Dragons!, and Merge Magic!, with more exciting projects in the pipeline. We are proudly part of the Zynga &amp;amp; Take-Two Interactive family. We do things differently here: we work in small self-managing teams, giving you an incredible amount of ownership, autonomy, and impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gram, everyone is expected to have a razor-sharp focus on creating a tangible impact on their team, their work environment, and on the overall company strategy. If you are motivated by autonomy, constant improvement, collaboration, and a sense of belonging, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The New Games team is looking for a highly skilled Senior VFX &amp;amp; Animation Generalist to join us. This is a hands-on and creative role for someone who can take visual effects and motion design from ideation to final in-game implementation. You will help design, build, and polish the VFX and motion language of the game, working closely with art, design, tech art, engineering, and production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crucially, we need someone who can take full ownership of the pipeline that drives the dynamic, deeply satisfying VFX and interactions seen in top-tier, highly polished casual puzzle games. We are looking for a generalist who combines strong artistic judgment with deep hands-on Unity experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, build, and optimize the VFX and animation pipeline, establishing efficient workflows tailored to producing the highly dynamic and rewarding interactions expected in top-tier casual puzzle games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create high-quality VFX and animations from ideation, concept, and visual exploration through to final implementation in Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement &quot;juicy&quot; interactions and celebratory effects that make every player interaction feel incredibly tactile and satisfying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring your own creative ideas to the table to make the puzzle pieces, UI, environments, and effects feel alive and responsive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with modern Unity workflows, including the Animation timeline, Particle System, Shader Graph, URP, custom materials, and animation-driven effects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate concepts, prototypes, gameplay needs, and rough ideas into clear, polished in-engine effects and motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize VFX and animations for mobile, balancing visual ambition with performance, memory, readability, and production constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify visual, technical, and workflow bottlenecks in the pipeline, and propose practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with tech art and engineering on shaders, tools, profiling, and runtime performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience (at a Senior, Lead, or Principal level) creating real-time VFX and animations for games, specifically casual puzzle games or highly polished free-to-play titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning, building, or significantly contributing to a VFX and animation pipeline for mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong grasp of fundamental animation principles applied to gameplay elements, UI, and effects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience making VFX and animations directly in Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio showing high-quality in-game VFX and motion design from idea to final implementation, highlighting &quot;juicy&quot; and satisfying visual feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to create assets from early ideation, concept, mood boards, mockups, prototypes, or rough direction and turn them into polished in-engine results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of mobile performance constraints and optimization techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to troubleshoot visual bugs, sorting issues, and performance problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills across art, design, technical art, engineering, and production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, organized, and self-driven approach to your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Successful In This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are not waiting for tasks to be assigned. You look at the game, understand what it needs, and help raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable owning a feature’s VFX and motion from start to finish: shaping the idea, exploring the visual direction, implementing it in Unity, polishing it, and keeping stakeholders informed and aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can explain your creative and technical choices clearly, take feedback well, and help the team make better visual decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most importantly, you make the game feel better and the player feel profoundly rewarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome onsite chef serving breakfast, lunch, and lots of treats (naughty and nice)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance and a favorable pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare cash plan including dental and optical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing tech to work with and consoles to play and relax with everywhere you look!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at &lt;a ---------- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gram Games is the studio behind popular titles like 1010!, Six!, Merge Dragons!, and Merge Magic!, with more exciting projects in the pipeline. We are proudly part of the Zynga &amp;amp; Take-Two Interactive family. We do things differently here: we work in small self-managing teams, giving you an incredible amount of ownership, autonomy, and impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gram, everyone is expected to have a razor-sharp focus on creating a tangible impact on their team, their work environment, and on the overall company strategy. If you are motivated by autonomy, constant improvement, collaboration, and a sense of belonging, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ASO &amp;amp; Partnerships leader to drive organic growth and deepen platform relationships for Merge Dragons, Monster Legends, Dragon City, FarmVille titles and many more. This role owns the studio&#39;s app store optimization strategy end-to-end and serves as our primary relationship holder with the major app store platforms — Google Play, the Apple App Store, Microsoft Store and Amazon Appstore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a team responsible for improving organic visibility, store conversion, and featuring, while working closely with Product, Creative, UA, and Data teams to unlock sustainable organic growth and strengthen the top of the funnel. You will mentor and empower the ASO team to deliver best-in-class execution, and you&#39;ll be the studio&#39;s trusted voice in front of our platform partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end ASO strategy for the portfolio, driving organic installs, store conversion, and keyword/category rankings across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage the yearly organic growth roadmap, including localization, seasonal, and launch strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the studio&#39;s platform partnership strategy, aligning featuring and promotional opportunities with business priorities and release calendars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Platform Partnerships&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic relationships with Google Play, Apple App Store, Microsoft Store, and Amazon Appstore partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure featuring, editorial placements, and promotional opportunities across launches, updates, and key seasonal moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for early access to platform betas, new store features, monetization tools, and APIs, and channel those opportunities back to Product and UA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the studio in partner reviews, QBRs, and industry events, and negotiate co-marketing and joint business plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Performance Optimization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead store listing experimentation (Custom Product Pages, Product Page Optimization, Google Play store listing experiments) to improve conversion rate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own keyword and metadata optimization, and build rigorous test roadmaps across icons, screenshots, preview videos, and descriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish measurement frameworks to attribute organic uplift and quantify the impact of ASO and featuring initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor ASO managers, specialists, and analysts; build structured career growth and execution excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Creative teams to fuel store asset testing velocity and creative breakthroughs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with UA, Product, and Data teams to ensure cohesive full-funnel optimization and visibility improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear accountability for results with transparent reporting and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve execution speed through better process, prioritization, and cross-team alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–10+ years of ASO or mobile organic growth experience in free-to-play, ideally in gaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of improving organic installs and store conversion at scale across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established working relationships with platform partner teams (Apple, Google, and ideally Microsoft and/or Amazon).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency in ASO tools (e.g. AppTweak, Sensor Tower, data.ai) and store listing A/B testing methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of app store algorithms, ranking factors, and each platform&#39;s merchandising ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence stakeholders and drive alignment across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: familiarity with Match-3/puzzle models and hybrid-casual or builder games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at &lt;a ---------- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Linux Administrator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £60,000 to £70,000 + Bonus + Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;T&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;he salary range for this role is broad, as we are able to consider varying levels of experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Any offer made will carefully take into account level of experience (including relevant industry experience), transferable relevant skills and previous relevant achievements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Riverlane is looking for an experienced Linux administrator to own and grow our core computational infrastructure. This is a hands-on role combining day-to-day administration of our High-Performance Computing (HPC) environment with longer-term planning, automation, and improvement of our infrastructure estate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be the primary owner of our HPC cluster and core Linux infrastructure, working closely with IT management and wider Infrastructure Team to keep systems reliable today while building towards a more resilient, scalable environment for tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;HPC Cluster Administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer and maintain the HPC cluster, including compute nodes, storage systems, and networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and evolve cluster topology, compute node configuration, and hardware resource utilisation as the estate grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the deployment, configuration, and troubleshooting of HPC tooling, particularly Slurm — including queue structures and job scheduling policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor system performance and ensure high availability of HPC resources, using observability tools such as Prometheus; investigate anomalies and outages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and maintain the network file storage solution for throughput, scalability, and latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Business As Usual (BAU) Administration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, patch, and troubleshoot core Linux infrastructure (RHEL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for complex technical issues raised by the Riverlane team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational upkeep of core infrastructure, including servers, tooling, and licence managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Synopsys EDA tooling, including licence server management, environment configuration, and performance optimisation for electronic design automation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide sound technical support to users of the HPC environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve self-service capability for users, enabling routine tasks (e.g. restarting VNC sessions, resetting passwords) to be performed without engineering intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Enhancement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate routine tasks using scripting and infrastructure-as-code tools (Bash, Python, Ansible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Infrastructure Team to plan and implement improvements to HPC infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own work packages and deliver them within agreed sprint windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain documentation for systems, processes, and configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with stakeholders on progress and delivered improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Security, Compliance &amp;amp; Resilience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security and compliance across the HPC estate, including security hardening and lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and develop the off-site backup strategy, ensuring data integrity, disaster recovery readiness, and compliance with data retention policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience administering and growing infrastructure in fast-paced engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Linux expertise: deep knowledge of Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL) administration, security hardening, lifecycle management, and troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience configuring, scaling, tuning, and troubleshooting job schedulers (e.g. Slurm) and distributed compute environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of network file storage protocols and network optimisation for computational workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with container environments and virtualisation infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency with infrastructure automation tools (Ansible, Python, Bash) and infrastructure-as-code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and disaster recovery strategy and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing licensed EDA or similar specialist software tooling (e.g. Synopsys) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to support both technical and non-technical users and translate complex issues into clear guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave, plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory, physics and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Senior Associate - Venture &amp;amp; Growth (m/f/d)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the team rewriting the rules in private markets.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moonfare delivers what few others can: the highly sought-after funds and hidden-gem investments that go beyond what most private banks offer. Every opportunity is subjected to a ruthless vetting process; the bar is unforgivingly high. The result? Institutional-quality portfolios for investors who demand more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines finance veterans with talent from tech, consulting, law and industries you’d never expect. Headquartered in Berlin, we operate from eight offices across Europe, the US and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build what&#39;s next in private markets, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn Moonfare&#39;s access to the world&#39;s leading venture managers into a steady, well-underwritten flow of single-company investments our clients can actually buy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A significant share of Moonfare&#39;s AuM sits in venture and growth, and the direct side of it, co-investments and secondaries in VC-backed companies, is where the business is growing fastest. Right now that dealflow arrives faster than we can review it, which puts the deployment of our proprietary funds at risk and caps how far the direct platform can scale. The scope of this role begins the moment an opportunity reaches us and ends when the deal closes, so operations sits outside it, as does the client raise itself. Your first year is weighted towards screening, pipeline and diligence, with the sourcing and business development side building from there as your market view and relationships deepen. You will work alongside senior members of the team rather than alone, and what moves forward is decided together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venture &amp;amp; Growth sits inside Moonfare&#39;s Investment team and runs two connected things. One is a multi-manager vehicle making primary fund investments into leading VC and growth managers across the US and Europe, where we have historically backed Founders Fund, a16z, Accel, Lightspeed, Khosla and General Catalyst. The other is the direct programme of co-investments and secondaries that those manager relationships generate, which is where this role&#39;s centre of gravity sits. You will report to the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing and work daily with the commercial team, who depend on you for qualified dealflow, and alongside Legal and Operations to close deals and launch the SPVs we distribute on the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the direct deal pipeline. &lt;/strong&gt;Everything from the moment an opportunity reaches us through to close is yours to run, so nothing sits unscreened and no access window quietly closes while we are still deciding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Screen inbound co-investments and secondaries, and bring a view to the team. &lt;/strong&gt;You run the first pass on what reaches us and form a position on it. What progresses is decided together with the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing and the wider team, so the value of your screen lies in the quality of the argument you bring to that conversation and in how sharply you separate the two or three worth our time from the rest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run diligence on direct deals. &lt;/strong&gt;The core of it is judgement on the business itself: how good the company is, how strong the founding team is, how large and how contested the market is, and whether the thesis survives contact with the evidence. The technical layer sits underneath, with cap table analysis, preference stacks and waterfalls, and pricing and NAV work on secondary positions, so we know exactly what we are buying and at what price. You will do this with support from senior members of the team, and contribute to primary fund diligence alongside the direct mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Author the investment memos that go to IC. &lt;/strong&gt;The committee decides on what you put in front of it, so a memo with a gap in it, an inaccuracy, or a risk nobody spotted becomes a decision made on the wrong basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the market view, and then the market position. &lt;/strong&gt;Relationships with intermediaries, GPs and, over time, founders are what get us into constrained opportunities and keep us current on where secondaries are pricing. This part of the role grows as you do, and watching how competitors structure and go to market belongs to it, because that is what keeps us competitive on price.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the process repeatable. &lt;/strong&gt;You will refine how we diligence direct deals and contribute to the sourcing, screening and monitoring tooling behind it, including AI-enabled approaches, so the volume we can handle is not capped by how much a person can read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn deals into something our clients can buy. &lt;/strong&gt;The commercial team depends on this seat for qualified dealflow and for support packaging opportunities into investor-ready materials. Fund deployment runs at the pace this work sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The next Moonfarian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Four or more years centred on venture and growth investing. &lt;/strong&gt;That comes along one of two paths. Either direct investment expertise, sourcing and diligencing investments in technology companies at a venture capital, growth equity or crossover fund, or an allocator seat focused on VC and growth where you have underwritten co-investments hands-on. Directly relevant adjacent backgrounds include TMT and technology investment banking, tech-focused private equity or software buyout, corporate development or corporate VC at a technology company, and consulting with a tech or commercial diligence focus. What matters most is a demonstrable track record of hands-on deal work: screening opportunities, running diligence, and taking a view through to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A network in venture you can already use. &lt;/strong&gt;This one is non-negotiable. Relationships with GPs, intermediaries such as placement agents and bankers, and other LPs and co-investors, enough to get us access to constrained opportunities, support diligence and track spin-out candidates. You do not need the network of someone twice your experience. You do need a real one, and you will build a much larger one here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment judgement you can defend. &lt;/strong&gt;You form a view on a company and argue it, including the case against. You can read a business and a founding team, size a market and test a thesis against what the evidence actually supports. You are genuinely fluent in emerging technology and can develop conviction on themes and business models, with AI front of mind but not the only lens. You assess attractiveness quickly on limited or imperfect information, you are comfortable with financial modelling and market analysis, and you know your way around cap tables, preference stacks and waterfalls, secondary pricing, VC term sheets and SPV mechanics. You can hold several live opportunities at once and prioritise sharply between them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An entrepreneurial instinct, which matters here as much as the investing. &lt;/strong&gt;This one is non-negotiable too. This is a builder&#39;s seat as much as an investor&#39;s. You want a hand in structuring, go-to-market, process design and the operational scaffolding of a business line that is still being built. Your AI fluency goes past using the tools to designing processes around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication that works in three different rooms, and relationships that outlast any one deal. &lt;/strong&gt;You can pitch and tailor to an investment committee, to a commercial team, and to clients, and prepare the reports and presentations each of them needs. Just as important is what you build over time with GPs and intermediaries, the standing that makes them think of us when something scarce comes up, because that is what turns a contact list into access. Excellent written and spoken English is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How the role is measured:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deals sourced, screened, and taken through to IC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timely deployment of Moonfare&#39;s proprietary funds, such as the Moonfare Technology Fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocation secured with GPs and intermediaries, meaning access we would not otherwise have had.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whether IC can decide on your memos without rework, and whether risks surface in diligence rather than after close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capital raised on direct deals and the performance ultimately generated. These are programme outcomes you contribute to rather than own alone, and they are read that way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By six months,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;the deal pipeline runs without the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing having to chase it. Opportunities are screened as they arrive, you are bringing a formed view on each one to the team, and the queue is visible to everyone who needs it.|&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By twelve months, &lt;/strong&gt;deal review is fully operationalised, with a process the team can run rather than one person&#39;s habits, and more than ten direct deals have been through IC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is unlikely to be a good match if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prefer to let relationships develop slowly and mostly in writing.&lt;/strong&gt; Much of our access comes from conversations with managers and intermediaries you do not know yet, and someone reserved about starting them will find the sourcing half of this job hard going.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want a defined process to work inside. &lt;/strong&gt;A good part of what this role runs does not exist yet, and you would be designing it while live deals are moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want sole authority over what you invest in.&lt;/strong&gt; We discuss deals as a team and decide together what progresses, which means your view gets argued with before it gets acted on. If you want to run your own book without that, this will frustrate you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What your growth could look like:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The next step from here is Associate Principal. Getting there means leading the majority of diligence processes rather than running them with support, and having a network that generates opportunities rather than one that keeps you informed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you get here that you would not get at a fund: you join the Head of VC &amp;amp; Direct Investing in GP conversations from early on and inherit access to a built-up base of manager relationships. You see the commercial side of raising capital for a deal alongside the investment side, which most investors never touch. And you help build a wider business, across a discretionary fund, capital raising for individual deals and, in time, a secondary market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you feel you do not meet all of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We can only accept applications from those eligible to live and work in&amp;nbsp;Berlin/London.&amp;nbsp;This is a hybrid role with office attendance required 4 days/week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that we do not accept applications sent by email. You should submit your application directly through our careers website.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Impact: You are empowered to bring ideas, make decisions, and see your work directly contribute to Moonfare&#39;s success.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Environment: We believe in open communication. You will receive regular updates on company strategy, performance against our KPIs, and key business decisions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We support your development with an individual growth budget of €1,500 or 2% of your base salary (whichever is higher).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Your Future: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your long-term financial goals with a company pension scheme, providing a 20% employer contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relax and Recharge: &lt;/strong&gt;You start with 25 vacation days and you’ll receive one additional day for each year of tenure, up to a maximum of 30 days. Moonfare gifts two days during our annual end of year company shutdown.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Lunch: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a free lunch every day that you are in the Berlin office, with a weekly changing menu that includes salads, curries, pastas, and a variety of vegan and vegetarian options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised Public Transport: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your commute with a monthly subsidy for the Deutschland job ticket, making your travel easier and more affordable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fitness and Wellbeing: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay active with a subsidised Urban Sports Club membership, giving you flexible access to a wide variety of sports and wellness activities across Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Culture of Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Join a team of ambitious, smart, and committed professionals who are passionate about revolutionising private market investing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reward: &lt;/strong&gt;As a performance-first company, we reward strong performance twice a year, so your impact translates directly into how your pay grows - through potential base salary increases and/or bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our clients come first, Moonfare comes second, and we prioritise ourselves third - Client-Centric Focus. &lt;/strong&gt;Putting clients first means creating value for them is essential. Placing Moonfare second signifies that our individual professional future at Moonfare depends on the company&#39;s commercial success. Prioritising ourselves third reflects our humility in putting clients and Moonfare before personal interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We pursue excellence and honor our promises - Commitment to Excellence. &lt;/strong&gt;We hold ourselves to the highest standards, taking responsibility for our failures, and celebrating our successes. We commit to deadlines and stick to them and we learn from our mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are here to win and to celebrate our collective achievements - Win together. &lt;/strong&gt;We are mission-focused and think and act like owners. We exemplify the attitude we expect and each of us commits to do what it takes to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We foster personal growth but each of us earns our place as a Moonfarian through merit - Growth and Merit.&lt;/strong&gt; We hire, retain, and develop exceptional people and invest in empowering them to excel. We must all earn our place at the table every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand the important role that diversity plays in our success. Different backgrounds, experiences and ideas push us further and raise the bar. We’re committed to developing an inclusive and safe culture where everyone - regardless of colour, race, religion, sex, origin, sexuality, disability, marital status, citizenship or gender identity - knows that they are an integral part of the team and can bring their full potential to their work.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you&#39;ll be working with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a SaaS scale up and one of the fastest growing tech companies in the North.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s 90+ of us around the UK with our HQ in Leeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our software is award-winning and used by 100,000s of students at over 1,000 universities &amp;amp; colleges worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re growing so we can achieve our mission to support 1 million students to become better learners by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; IC4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit: &lt;/strong&gt;LX&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for our first Senior Growth Marketer (IC4) to join our new Study Platform unit. In this high-impact, pioneering role, you will be responsible for acquiring and growing an engaged student user base for our 0-1 Genio Planner product and the broader Genio Study Platform we are building on top of it. You will drive student adoption, nurture an active cohort of learner advocates, and convert user momentum into the evidence and pipelines needed to expand into a high-value, institution-wide B2C2B sales motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User Acquisition &amp;amp; Retention:&lt;/strong&gt; Building Planner’s D2C user base from zero into a meaningful, retained cohort of student users ahead of and beyond our September 2026 launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Ownership &amp;amp; Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Operating in high-ambiguity, pre-PMF environments to design, execute, and analyze rapid growth experiments across paid social, campus ambassador programs, organic SEO, and referral channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signal Architecture &amp;amp; Budgeting:&lt;/strong&gt; Defining and tracking crucial metrics like activation, engagement, retention, and .edu concentration while managing the Planner growth budget to defend and optimize spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Gathering qualitative and quantitative user feedback from Planner users and translating it into clear, prioritized inputs for our product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLG to Sales Handoff:&lt;/strong&gt; Working closely with the institutional sales team to spot universities with concentrated student usage and package that data into qualified leads for future high-value sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥 Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate with high autonomy on a dynamic 12–14 person team, working most closely with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learner Experience Product Development team (insert here who they will be)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holly, our CPO (whom you will report into)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wider Genio marketing and brand team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of owning user acquisition, activation, and retention strategy in a pre-PMF or high-ambiguity scale-up context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid Experimentation Cadence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to run disciplined, evidence-led growth experiments and quickly pivot or scale based on results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Analytics Rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience establishing signal architecture, analyzing retention, calculating CAC, and demonstrating ROI on marketing spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder-Mode Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter who moves comfortably between high-level strategy and rolling up their sleeves for hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong passion for the learner experience, actively collecting and translating quantitative and qualitative user feedback to shape product features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus / Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in EdTech or consumer products targeting higher education students.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with transitioning product-led growth (PLG) adoption into large B2B sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 Salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£60,000 - £70,000 dependent upon experience&lt;br&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;br&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;br&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;br&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;br&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;br&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;br&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;br&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;br&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;br&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;br&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model, including supporting our Genios who are based remotely across the UK. If you are more than 50 miles away from the office, we offer full remote working support, with the opportunity to join colleagues for in-person collaboration several times a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hi 👋 we’re Genio. We create beautifully simple learning tools that boost knowledge, skills, and confidence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a SaaS scale up and one of the fastest growing tech companies in the North.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s 90+ of us around the UK with our HQ in Leeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our software is award-winning and used by 100,000s of students at over 1,000 universities &amp;amp; colleges worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re growing so we can achieve our mission to support 1 million students to become better learners by 2030.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt; About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career track:&lt;/strong&gt; MG4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unit:&lt;/strong&gt; Learner Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Lead you&#39;ll partner directly with the CPO to drive delivery, engineering standards, and team health as we build Genio&#39;s next flagship product. In this fast-paced, early-stage environment, you lead through empowerment rather than doing the work yourself; setting up your Tech Leads for success, fostering a culture of rapid AI-assisted experimentation, and ensuring problems are tackled early. Bringing sharp technical understanding to challenge assumptions and spot risk, you&#39;ll balance speed with smart standards to turn product priorities into shipped, learnable product.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will be responsible for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Run delivery for the Learning Experience team, from priority to shipped product. Ensure the team&#39;s delivery rhythm and visibility across planning, prioritisation, and release, keeping cycle times short and progress visible. Work with the CPO to translate product priorities and validation goals into sequenced engineering work, provide an honest view of what is achievable within the budget, remove blockers quickly, and ensure engineers are empowered to solve learner problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards and Ways of Working: &lt;/strong&gt;Bring genuine technical understanding to the team&#39;s engineering standards and ways of working, calibrated to a validation-stage product: fast by default, disciplined where it counts. Drive a culture of experimentation and fast feedback, champion AI-assisted engineering across the team, and ensure the team meets non-negotiable security and compliance standards set by Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage software engineers directly through regular 1-on-1s, development plans, performance management, and honest, timely feedback. Build a culture of collaboration, inclusiveness, trust, and respect. Coach team members on quality, communication, and best practices, address skill gaps, and take an active role in recruitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with the Product Manager (who owns what and why) and Principal Engineer (who owns architecture), while owning the how and ensuring it ships. Bring genuine data proficiency so instrumentation, measurement, and learning are part of every release, and assist in communicating company goals and vision to provide clear direction for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast, dependable delivery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;the team ships quickly and predictably, so product hypotheses are tested with real learners at the pace validation demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of rapid iteration and experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;the team defaults to shipping, measuring, and learning, with AI-assisted development used wherever it compounds speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards that fit the stage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;quality, security, and engineering discipline are held where they matter, and deliberately lightweight where they don&#39;t yet, with trade-offs made consciously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A high-performing, motivated team:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;engineers are coached, developed, stretched, and supported, with clear expectations and honest feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A well-run budget:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;the team&#39;s size, tooling, and spend stay within what has been agreed, and the CPO always has a concrete view of what the current budget can deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👥&lt;strong&gt; Meet the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be working most closely with our Chief Product Officer, Principal Engineer (Learning Experience), Tech Leads, Engineers, Senior Data Engineer, Learner Research and Design colleagues, Product Managers, and Principal Platform Engineer (Operations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports directly into the Chief Product Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Leadership Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Directly leading and managing engineers, ideally in an early-stage or new product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Engineering Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience in hands-on software engineering roles, working with well-crafted and maintainable code, with sound judgement about when craft pays back and when speed wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Delivery Instincts:&lt;/strong&gt; Short cycles, visible progress, and honest communication when commitments are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crisis-Capable: &lt;/strong&gt;Able to take ownership of a live problem end-to-end and see it through without escalating back or waiting for direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Genuine fluency with AI-assisted development and an appetite to push what it makes possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Proficiency: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfortable using product analytics and experiment results to steer the team&#39;s work, and able to bring Product Managers and others along in that reasoning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Long-term focused where it matters—supporting structures and habits that will scale if the platform succeeds, without investing prematurely in capabilities or abstractions that are not yet justified by validated needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Passionate views, loosely held—able to argue your point of view passionately, but willing to accept that the needs of others, the group, or the business may mean other approaches are adopted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus / Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage-Appropriate Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience balancing fast-paced product validation and experimentation with strict operational, security, and compliance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 Salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;£115,000 - £125,000 dependent upon experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖️ 33 days annual leave (Inclusive of bank holidays)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎄 3 gifted days off at Christmas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 EMI Share Options Scheme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎓 Generous individual learning and training allowance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⌚ Truly flexible hours to suit when you work best&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Full home working set up and beautiful collaborative office space&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Free Leeds City Centre office parking&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Nomad working policy with family travel insurance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 Enhanced 26 weeks maternity and 4 weeks paternity (fully paid)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤍 Health cash plan (from glasses to massages)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💸 6% employer pension contribution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📍 Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our beautiful office space in Leeds is our key hub for collaboration, and we love to get together in person. We operate a flexible hybrid working model. While we don’t require a set number of days in the office, we’re happy to discuss ways of working at interview. If you have any questions in the meantime please reach out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 What to expect next:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll review your application and provide a response within 1 week. Even if it’s not the news you’d hoped for, we appreciate it’s good to know either way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we invite you to meet with us for interview, here’s an overview of what the process will look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening interview with someone in our Recruitment team (30 minutes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage one: interview with a small panel of interviewers including; the CEO, CPO, and another Genio colleague (1 hour). This will include a scenario with competency and behavioural questions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A take-home task to be completed ahead of the second stage interview, which will be presented during the interview.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage two: Task presentation and discussion, leadership focussed behavioural questions and an open conversation (90 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final stage: Culture and values interview (1 hour)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ahead of your interview you will receive a confirmation email outlining who you’ll be meeting and when, anything you’ll need to prepare in advance and any resources we think you might find helpful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Technology and Cyber team are looking for an experienced Senior Integration Engineer to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa has grown so fast, and it continues to grow rapidly. Those new joiners keep on coming! We are a global function supporting the firm as it enters new markets. We are re-architecting and evolving our cloud-based business systems and infrastructure. We are on a mission to develop great technology products, deliver great services, and protect the trust our people and clients place in us. We have installed a new operating system for ourselves, and rebooted what was a corporate IT department into a corporate technology company, transforming the way we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now we are building for the next era of work. AI is becoming part of the fabric of how Baringa operates, and we are developing the products and platforms that will help colleagues find knowledge, act on insight, navigate complexity, and get work done with greater speed, quality, and confidence. Some of this will be visible through intelligent experiences and agentic systems. Some of it will sit beneath the surface: data products, workflow platforms, integrations, automations, cyber security, governance, and the architecture that makes all of it safe, scalable, resilient, and useful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So much to build on, so much to progress. So much to deliver. So much to play for!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you know what though? We are going to do it. All of it and more. We have the support to drive change. We have the belief. We are going to do great things. Come and join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and support enterprise-grade integrations across Baringa’s business systems and technology platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Azure Function App solutions that enable secure, reliable and scalable integration between strategic systems including Dynamics 365, Workday, Dataverse and other enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain custom APIs, services and integration components that support critical business processes and data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement integration patterns using Azure services including API Management, Service Bus, Storage Accounts and Key Vault.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ongoing modernisation of legacy integrations and data exchange processes, helping create more resilient and future-ready platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical delivery from design through to deployment, support and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve performance, reliability, scalability and maintainability across the integration estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions with appropriate security, monitoring, governance and operational controls, ensuring risks are understood and managed from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in troubleshooting, production support and incident resolution for business-critical integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Owners, Engineers and stakeholders to understand requirements and translate them into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing, building and supporting integrations using Azure Function Apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating Dynamics 365 applications using custom APIs and native integration capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of REST APIs and modern integration design principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Azure integration services including API Management (APIM), Service Bus, Storage Accounts and Key Vault.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Dataverse integration patterns and the wider Power Platform ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and securing integration solutions using OAuth, Microsoft Entra ID, Managed Identity and modern enterprise networking patterns, including private endpoints, network isolation and secure service-to-service communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and mitigate technical, security and operational risks in integration solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing monitoring, logging, alerting, retry handling and support processes for production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leveraging and building with frontier AI engineering tools and autonomous frameworks. You possess a strong architectural discipline, ensuring that while we aggressively push the boundaries of AI-assisted development, we do so with a rigorous commitment to code quality, safety, and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous Annual Leave Policy:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We know that the ‘ideal’ work-life balance will vary from person to person and change at different stages of our working lives. To accommodate this, we have implemented a hybrid working policy and introduced more flexibility around taking unpaid leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Corporate Responsibility Days:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Our world is important to us, so all our employees get 3 every year to help social and environmental causes and increase our impact on the communities that mean the most to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Wellbeing Fund:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; We want to encourage all employees to take charge and prioritise their own wellbeing. We’ve introduced our annual People Fund to support this by offering every individual a fund to support and manage their wellbeing through an activity of their choice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;33&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Profit Share Scheme:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; All employees participate in the Baringa Group Profit Share Scheme so everyone has a stake in the company’s success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1320,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;An award-winning workplace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Using business as a force for good.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Join us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Baringa Privacy Notices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For UK &amp;amp; EU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf&quot;&gt;EU Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For the USA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For Australia &amp;amp; Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp;amp; APAC)&lt;/a&gt;, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at &lt;a ----------Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is looking for an accomplished sales professional to join our Sales Team. AI is moving from experimentation into production, and this role is an opportunity to break into AI while doing meaningful enterprise selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, AI Hunter, your job is simple: create new SingleStore customers. You will find companies building AI applications where data access, real-time context, memory, retrieval, or operational scale is becoming a constraint—and turn those challenges into new SingleStore customers. You will own a broad territory, build a majority self-sourced pipeline, create demand in an emerging category, and close greenfield enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true hunting role. You will engage customers before they have a defined project, develop customer-specific points of view, create urgency around business and technical problems, work with technical experts to land first production workloads, and build a measurable new-logo business with broad ownership. The ideal candidate is a measurable enterprise hunter who is competitive, curious, technically credible, resilient, and able to sell business outcomes. Direct AI sales experience is valuable, but proven selling ability and technical curiosity matter more than a narrow “AI seller” title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory strategy for net-new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect fearlessly across a broad account universe using proactive, persistent outbound, account-based, partner, and market-education motions; stay resilient and effective through rejection and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Form account hypotheses, map the buying center, and earn first meetings with relevant points of view tailored to the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage executive, business, technical, security, and procurement stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead great business-first discovery, connect AI and data challenges to fundable goals, and build quantified ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop champions, multi-thread the buying group, earn executive and economic-buyer access, and maintain stakeholder alignment; own the stakeholder plan, mutual action plan, close plan, value case, stage gates, forecast, and commercial outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles through technical validation, security, legal, procurement, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions and Forward Deployment Engineers and cross-functional teams to validate technical fit and establish the first production workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate competitive displacement and maintain disciplined activity management, CRM hygiene, reporting, qualification, forecasting, and opportunity management; showcase clear metrics such as pipeline created, meetings, conversion, quota attainment, and new-logo performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be AI fluent: use AI and research tools productively and responsibly while applying judgment, validating outputs, and separating facts from hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the assigned territory as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quota-carrying B2B enterprise software sales experience, ideally selling to large or technically sophisticated organizations; experience in data, cloud, analytics, AI, or adjacent technical domains is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repeated, quantified quota success with clear ownership of new-logo wins and self-sourced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving executives, technical evaluators, security, legal, finance, procurement, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell measurable business outcomes and build ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in an adjacent domain such as databases, data infrastructure, analytics, AI/ML, cloud, Kubernetes, developer tools, cybersecurity, observability, or open-source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong qualification, account planning, forecasting, CRM, negotiation, and deal-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning velocity and coachability, demonstrated through specific behavior change after feedback; ability to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence, customer trust, resilience, intellectual honesty, and excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A., B.S. degree or equivalent in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Fortune 500 or security-sensitive organizations, cloud ecosystems, open-source or consumption-based products, or emerging categories is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and/or German&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

