&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joining Collibra’s Growth Marketing team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collibra&#39;s Growth Marketing team drives the regional strategies and programs that connect our solutions to the accounts and buyers who need them most — and we&#39;re looking for an EMEA Senior Field Marketing Manager to lead that charge across the region. Reporting to the Director of Field &amp;amp; Event Marketing, you&#39;ll own the strategy and execution that influences the pipeline across EMEA from building awareness with the right accounts to accelerating opportunities through demand generation and targeted account-based plays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with EMEA GTM leaders, Integrated Marketing, and Growth Marketing to translate global programs into high-impact regional initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Values-in-action (We show up to win): This team moves with urgency, makes data-driven decisions, and continuously optimizes to deliver the best outcomes for the business and our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in our London office. Our hybrid model means you’ll work from the office at least two days each week. This setup helps us stay connected, work more closely together, and keep making progress as a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Field Marketing Managers at Collibra are responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute fully integrated, multi-channel marketing plans across the DACH, NEUR and APAC regions to drive demand generation, land new logos, and achieve new business pipeline targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run Account-Based Marketing (ABM) programs in close partnership with sales — identifying and prioritizing high-value accounts, personalizing engagement across channels, and accelerating pipeline progression within target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global campaigns into regional digital and engagement roadmaps, providing strategic direction based on EMEA industry frameworks and market dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align with GTM leaders, Integrated Marketing, and Growth Marketing to develop EMEA field marketing priorities and multi-channel plans using a data-driven approach to decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze marketing performance, delivering insights that optimize strategies and investments to maximize ROI against revenue objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Field, Partner, or Channel Marketing in a B2B enterprise technology environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record delivering regional demand generation programs that achieve pipeline targets, with measurable results across top, mid, and bottom of funnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing ABM programs, including partnering with sales to define target account lists and drive personalized engagement at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional program management experience executing integrated marketing programs, including with enterprise partners such as SAP, Google Cloud, or GSIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with experience presenting marketing strategy and performance to senior stakeholders and customer audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must have native proficiency in German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel up to 25%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated proficiency in leveraging AI tools (e.g., Claude, Gemini, ChatGPT, Copilot) to solve real-world business challenges, drive measurable outcomes, or streamline workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or equivalent related working experience is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics-driven and analytical you translate data into clear insights and use them to make fast, informed investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and skilled at building alignment across GTM, sales, and marketing to move programs forward with shared accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and solutions-oriented, anticipating obstacles and operating with urgency in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with applying marketing technologies including Salesforce, Tableau, 6Sense, HockeyStack, Asana, and event platforms such as Zuddl&amp;nbsp; to manage programs and measure results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and comfortable navigating ambiguity, iterating quickly based on market feedback and performance data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English and German (C1 level or above)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your first month, you will: Complete onboarding, build key relationships with EMEA GTM leaders and cross-functional marketing partners, and conduct an audit of current EMEA field marketing programs and pipeline performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your third month, you will: Own and execute your first regional marketing program, partner with sales to define and align on the ABM target account strategy, and begin contributing measurably to the EMEA pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your sixth month, you will: Deliver measurable progress against EMEA pipeline targets, maintain a full regional marketing calendar, and demonstrate ABM-driven improvements in target account engagement and pipeline progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Benefits at Collibra&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collibra recognizes and values that everyone has different needs, interests, and life goals. We built our benefits program with flexibility in mind to support you and your loved ones through a diverse range of circumstances and life events. These flexible offerings sit on a foundation of competitive compensation, health coverage, and time off. Learn more about &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.collibra.com/us/en/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;Collibra’s benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create inclusion and belonging through how we onboard, meet, connect, engage, and communicate. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.collibra.com/us/en/company/careers/dei&quot;&gt;diversity, equity, and inclusion&lt;/a&gt; at Collibra.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Collibra, we’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We realize the key to creating a company with a world-class culture and employee experience comes from who we hire and creating a workplace that celebrates everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With this, we proudly consider qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, creed, gender, national origin, age, disability, veteran status, sexual orientation, pregnancy, sex, gender identity, gender expression, genetic information, physical or mental disability, HIV status, registered domestic partner status, caregiver status, marital status, veteran or military status, citizenship status or any other legally protected category. If you have a need that requires accommodation, let us know by completing our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.collibra.com/us/en/company/careers/accommodations&quot;&gt;Accommodations for Applicants form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact at LILA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a talent-dense, high-agency AI safety team at Lila that will engage all core teams within the organization (science, model training, lab integration, etc.), to identify and mitigate risks from scientific superintelligence while retaining the core scientific discovery capabilities of the stack. The initial focus of this team will be to build and implement a bespoke safety strategy for Lila, tailored to its specific goals and deployment strategies. This will involve technical safety strategy development, broader ecosystem engagement, safety-focused evaluations, safety systems to mitigate risks, and a research agenda that explores longer-term needs such as oversight of superintelligent scientific systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a chemist to map risk across the chemical sciences domain: you will connect deep chemistry expertise with dual-use risk assessment to help safeguard increasingly capable scientific AI. You will investigate how advances in chemical research could change harmful capabilities, including established and emerging chemical threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map chemical misuse risks across scientific models, agents and automated experimentation, connecting scientific advances to harmful applications and identifying emerging or overlooked pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess how scientific feasibility, practical complexity and actors&#39; expertise or resources affect the plausibility and likelihood of misuse, including which constraints AI could change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distinguish established capabilities, plausible future developments and weakly supported hypotheses, updating assessments as scientific evidence and AI capabilities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps in coverage, frame questions for consultants and specialist organizations, and assess and integrate their findings with support from the expert-program team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate scientific risk judgments into dual-use policy boundaries, evaluation priorities and mitigation requirements that preserve beneficial chemistry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with threat modelers, evaluation researchers and mitigation teams to design informative assessments, interpret red-team findings and test safeguards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise (a PhD, or comparable experience) in synthetic chemistry or a closely related discipline, demonstrated through substantial research or applied work and sound interpretation of experimental evidence. This includes a background in molecular design and medicinal chemistry, inorganic and organometallic chemistry, synthesis, process development and formulations, or other relevant sub-fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantive experience assessing chemical dual-use risks (e.g. across national security, export controls, or other chemical risk tracking such as the CWC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong scientific judgment about feasibility, uncertainty and practical constraints, including the ability to investigate unfamiliar questions and recognize the limits of your expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify appropriate specialists, critically assess their evidence and combine findings across disciplines into defensible risk assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear scientific communication, independent research judgment and an ability to collaborate across science, engineering and policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience applying domain expertise to AI safety through one or more of: scientific analysis informing threat models; evaluation or red-teaming work; or mitigation design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience commissioning specialist research or coordinating external scientific collaborators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with automated chemistry, scientific modeling or the translation of computational findings into physical experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive base compensation with bonus potential and generous early-stage equity. Your final offer will reflect your background, expertise, and expected impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;U.S. Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time U.S. employees receive a comprehensive benefits program including medical, dental, and vision coverage; employer-paid life and disability insurance; flexible time off with generous company wide holidays; paid parental leave; an educational assistance program; commuter benefits, including bike share memberships for office based employees; and a company subsidized lunch program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Benefits.&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time employees outside the U.S. receive a comprehensive benefits program tailored to their region. USD salary ranges apply only to U.S.-based positions; international salaries are set to local market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Expected Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$148,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$208,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LILA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lila Sciences is building Scientific Superintelligence™ to solve humankind&#39;s greatest challenges. We believe science is the most inspiring frontier for AI. Rather than hard-coding expert knowledge into tools, LILA builds systems that can learn for themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LILA combines advanced AI models with proprietary AI Science Factory™ instruments into an operating system for science that executes the entire scientific method autonomously, accelerating discovery at unprecedented speed, scale, and impact across medicine, materials, and energy. Learn more at www.lila.ai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Guided by our core values of truth, trust, curiosity, grit, and velocity, we move with startup speed while tackling problems of historic importance. If this sounds like an environment you&#39;d love to work in, even if you don&#39;t meet every qualification listed above, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re All In&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lila Sciences is&amp;nbsp;committed to equal employment opportunity&amp;nbsp;regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Information you provide during your application process will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.lila.ai/candidate-privacy-policy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note to Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lila Sciences does not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than candidates. The submission of unsolicited resumes by recruitment or staffing agencies to Lila Sciences or its employees is strictly prohibited unless contacted directly by Lila Science’s internal Talent Acquisition team. Any resume submitted by an agency in the absence of a signed agreement will automatically become the property of Lila Sciences, and Lila Sciences will not owe any referral or other fees with respect thereto.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;At Dragos, the mission is personal. The systems we protect deliver the water you drink, power your home, and keep the hospitals your community depends on running. Those critical infrastructure systems that power our civilization around the world are under attack every day by adversaries. When those systems fail, people are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;immediately&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;at risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are the global leader in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;xOT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;cybersecurity, combining technology, threat intelligence, and expert services. The people here chose this work because they understand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;what is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;at stake&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot;&gt;. Here, you will find a remote-first mission-driven team across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and APAC built on authenticity, transparency, and trust. If safeguarding the systems that protect your family, friends, and community is the kind of work that matters to you, you are in the right place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW107525881 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;As the Customer Success Manager (CSM) for EUROPE, you will serve as a trusted advisor to our industrial clients throughout their journey with Dragos. You’ll play a pivotal role in driving adoption, ensuring satisfaction, and aligning our solutions with the customer’s operational and security goals. You will be the bridge between Dragos and our customers, advocating for their success while aligning with internal teams to ensure world-class delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Serve as the primary post-sales point of contact for customers in the EUROPE region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Drive successful onboarding, implementation, and adoption of Dragos solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner with customers to define success criteria and help them achieve measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Conduct regular business reviews to assess value realization and identify expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Act as the voice of the customer internally by relaying feedback to Product, Engineering, and Sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Manage renewals and support customer retention efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales, Professional Services, and Support to ensure a seamless customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Travel as needed across the region to build strong relationships and drive customer engagement (up to 30%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Monitor and manage customer health metrics, identifying risks early and taking action to ensure account stability and satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proactively manage and escalate issues as needed, including the development and execution of at-risk account recovery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in Customer Success, Account Management, or similar roles in cybersecurity, enterprise SaaS, or industrial sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with industrial control systems (ICS), OT security, or critical infrastructure environments is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage complex customer relationships and influence key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience working with EUROPE clients and understanding regional business practices and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Comfortable working independently and across time zones in a remote-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Multilingual candidates, particularly those speaking German and other European languages, are highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Salary: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;£85,000.00&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Competitive Equity Package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Benefits Plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
