&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our global Product Marketing team, working closely with Vianney Lacroix, Global Product Marketing Manager, who leads our Connect product launches. The team is led by Danielle Delahunty-James, VP of Product Marketing, and brings together 4 Product Marketing Managers. Together, you&#39;ll be shaping how Mirakl&#39;s products are positioned and brought to market across global audiences, working hand in hand with your product manager counterpart.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
