&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our EMEA Brand Design team led by Gavin Jones, Brand Design Manager. The team consists of 3 people, including this internship role, working closely with the wider Marketing organisation across the region. Together, you&#39;ll be bringing Mirakl&#39;s visual identity to life — crafting compelling, on-brand assets that support campaigns, drive awareness, and strengthen how we show up across digital and print channels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;This is a hands-on team where you&#39;ll be involved from day one. I&#39;ll be acting as a close mentor throughout your time here, and you&#39;ll have real ownership of projects. We check in weekly as a team to review progress, tackle challenges, and share best practices. You&#39;ll also collaborate closely with the wider Marketing team and manage incoming projects through Wrike, our project management tool.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; — Gavin Jones, Brand Design Manager&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Design visually engaging assets for digital platforms including social media, websites, and email campaigns, ensuring consistency with Mirakl&#39;s brand identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Create and layout print materials such as brochures, posters, flyers, and business cards that reflect our brand standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Contribute creative ideas in brainstorming sessions and support the evolution of Mirakl&#39;s visual identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Edit and optimise images for web use, balancing visual impact with performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Support multimedia projects including video editing or animation, as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-my-4 s-border-b s-border-primary-150 dark:s-border-primary-150-night&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
