&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Currently studying or recently graduated in Graphic Design, Visual Communication, or a related creative field&lt;/li&gt;
