&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
