&lt;p&gt;Joining Capco means becoming part of an innovative and dynamic consultancy firm, committed to fostering an inclusive environment where you are encouraged to #BeYourselfAtWork. We embrace individuality as a key factor in promoting diversity and inclusion, values that sit at the core of our success. We aim to attract a wide variety of talented professionals with different skills and experiences. If you require any adjustments to support your application process, please feel free to inform us at any stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT CAPCO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global technology and business consultancy that is passionate about supporting clients in the financial services sector to grow and succeed in today&#39;s ever-changing world. We are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experts in banking, capital markets, payments and asset and wealth management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted advisors in core banking, securities and wealth management transformation, regulatory change, risk management and technology modernization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company dedicated to continuous development and excited to welcome top talent to help us drive innovation and deliver lasting results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A business built on agility, collaboration, and entrepreneurial spirit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior Business Analyst to help shape the strategic transformation of our Financial Crime Compliance (FCC) and Market Conduct &amp;amp; Trade Surveillance (MCTS) capabilities within Legal &amp;amp; Compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of compliance, business, technology, architecture and data, you will shape strategic target states, assess current capabilities and translate business and control objectives into prioritised transformation roadmaps and actionable requirements. You will facilitate complex cross-functional decisions and provide clear recommendations to senior management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the senior business-analysis and transformation lead for selected FCC and MCTS initiatives, shaping target states and roadmaps while working in close partnership with Compliance, Technology, Architecture, Data and Programme Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO DAY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the business definition of strategic target states, facilitating alignment across Compliance, Technology, Architecture and Data and ensuring that agreed target states are translated into actionable transformation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess current capabilities and conduct gap analyses across processes, organisation, systems, architecture, data quality and governance, translating findings into prioritised transformation measures and investment considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define business and technology requirements and develop relevant use cases and options, including opportunities to improve data quality, reduce false positives, automate and scale alert handling, and strengthen monitoring and surveillance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate target states into structured multi-year transformation roadmaps, defining priorities, milestones, dependencies, sequencing, responsibilities, investment considerations and key trade-offs across risk reduction, regulatory need, business value and delivery feasibility. Facilitate cross-functional decision-making across business, technology and control functions, frame key options and trade-offs, and prepare concise recommendations and decision materials for senior&amp;nbsp;management. Define measurable transformation outcomes and success criteria, such as improved control effectiveness, reduced manual effort and false positives, better data quality and lineage, increased automation, and improved operational scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure traceability from regulatory, policy and control objectives through business requirements, solution design and implementation outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR CAPCO FIT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated Financial Crime Compliance expertise combined with project and ideally consulting experience in the design and digital transformation of FCC solutions within a comparable financial-services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to work across business architecture, solution/enterprise architecture and data disciplines, translating business and control requirements into architectural, process and data implications.” Strong expertise in Financial Crime Compliance, with deep experience in one or more core domains such as AML/CTF, sanctions or PEP screening, and sufficient breadth to work effectively across adjacent FCC areas including tax compliance.Proven change and organisational capabilities, particularly stakeholder management and facilitation, Target Operating Model definition and the preparation of decision materials for senior management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conceptual and analytical capabilities, with experience translating strategic target states into prioritised multi-year roadmaps and implementation plans within complex transformation environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and German are a must for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BONUS POINTS FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within Market Conduct, Trade Surveillance or comparable monitoring and surveillance environments; deep MCTS expertise is advantageous but not required where the candidate brings strong transferable FCC transformation experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing strategic concepts spanning Financial Crime Compliance, Legal &amp;amp; Compliance and wider banking transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with surveillance challenges such as false-positive reduction, alert management, data quality and the integration of relevant communications and market information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assessing investment requirements and prioritising transformation initiatives across three-to-five-year roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating transformation plans with wider enterprise architecture, technology or bank-wide strategic programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the Next Step&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we would love to hear from you. This is an opportunity to make a difference and contribute to a highly successful company with a significant growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences Principal, Business Development (EMEA), you will partner with EMEA Sales and Sales Engineering leaders to shape and execute the region’s HLS growth strategy. You will connect market opportunity to field execution: prioritizing segments and accounts, developing repeatable vertical and horizontal plays, strengthening the organization and partner ecosystem, and leading critical customer and alliance initiatives. You will be expected to operate comfortably at three levels:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Strategic: Define where and how Everpure should win in European healthcare and life sciences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Organizational: Build the capabilities, coverage, relationships, and operating cadence required to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Commercial: Personally advance priority opportunities, alliances, and executive relationships to closed business and measurable customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires a combination of HLS credibility, technical fluency in data and AI platforms, commercial ownership, and the ability to influence across country sales, SE, partners, and corporate teams without relying on formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Pipeline &amp;amp; Financial Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the booking targets and financial performance for the segment by developing and executing a multi year strategic growth plan. Drive and scale the overarching pipeline and bookings targets across the EMEA ecosystem, establishing clear qualification criteria and pipeline visibility.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the EMEA Value Proposition:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Define and articulate the value proposition for Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences to drive growth and establish Everpure as the industry leader.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Execute Joint GTM Plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and launch strategic go-to-market plans with priority partners, aligning internal cross-functional EMEA teams (Partner Account Teams, Core Sales, Alliances, Marketing) to unlock high-potential HLS customer accounts and activate new revenue streams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Strategic Alliances:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Orchestrate strategic vertical alliances and operationalize relationships with key partners to secure reference architectures and joint go to market motions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable and Mobilize the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip sales teams and partners with the specialized tools, training, and playbooks they need to successfully position and sell vertical solutions. Train and align Partner representatives ensuring they can effectively articulate our value proposition, economic differentiation, and technical sizing for healthcare compliance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Joint Demand Gen &amp;amp; Thought Leadership:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Act as a spokesperson for your vertical vision in customer meetings, industry events, analyst briefings, and media opportunities. Build credibility as a principal advisor by shaping the industry narrative around intelligent data foundations and enterprise AI adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HLS &amp;amp; Alliance Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven success leading strategic business development or alliance management within the technology sector, with a deep understanding of customers solutions, cloud economics, and the specific regulatory, data, and compliance needs of the EMEA Healthcare and Life Sciences sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute the global strategy for your segment in partnership with Product Management, Sales, and Engineering teams. A track record of balancing high-level strategy with a &quot;roll-up-your-sleeves&quot; execution mindset, showing a strong ability to build trust and influence executive leaders across partner organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding business acumen and communication skills, with a collaborative approach to thriving in a fast-paced, cross-functional, and multi-cultural EMEA environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; We operate in a hybrid/field-based model. You will be expected to work effectively from a regional corporate office in a key EMEA market, with the ability to travel 25–40% across the region as business needs require.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Switzerland on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Mit unseren flexiblen Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Remote Work gestaltest du deinen Alltag so, wie er zu dir passt. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
